#org @gText_Fuschia_OakAid1
Hi! Remember me?\nI'm one of Prof. Oak's Aides.\pHe entrusted me to give you these\nitems.

#org @gText_Fuschia_OakAid2
It may seem counterintuitive to\ninflict status on your own Pok\e-\lmon, but some of them greatly\lbenefit from it. 

#org @gText_Fuschia_NastyPlot1
Hehehe... how shall I go about\nmy plan for world domination...\pSorry, I was just mumbling to\nmyself. But[.]\pWould you like me to teach\nNasty Plot?

#org @gText_Fuschia_NastyPlot2
May your suspicious schemes go\nby smoothly. 

#org @gText_Fuschia_NastyPlot3
Hmm[.] perhaps I'm too sus. 

#org @gText_Fuschia_Egg1
Hi[.]I'm a special move tutor.\pI teach Egg moves, so you don't have\nto go through the trouble of\lbreeding.\pI'll need a [GREEN]Heart Scale[BLUE] though.

#org @gText_Fuschia_Egg2
Would you like me to teach\nan egg move?

#org @gText_Fuschia_Egg3
Alright, who wants it?

#org @gText_Fuschia_Egg4
[BLUE]Thank you, enjoy!

#org @gText_Fuschia_EggNo
Well then[.]

#org @gText_Fuschia_EggNo2
Sorry[.]\pIt doesn't appear as if I have a\nmove I can teach that Pok\emon.

#org @gText_Fuschia_EggNo3
Sorry[.] that's an egg.

#org @gText_Fuschia_EggNew1
Would you like me to teach\nan egg move?

#org @gText_Fuschia_EggWhichMove
Which move should I teach?

#org @gText_Fuschia_GuessCry1
Hi there, I have a valuable\nservice!\pI teach Egg moves, so you don't have\nto go through the trouble of\lbreeding.

#org @gText_Fuschia_GuessCry1_1
However, I'll only do it for\na true Pok\emon trainer.\pSo, I'll play 4 Pok\emon cries\nand you'll have to guess\lthe Pok\emon the cry corresponds\lto.\pYou up for it?

#org @gText_Fuschia_GuessCry2
Alright, here's one.\pThis one's from Generation 1!

#org @gText_Fuschia_GuessCry3
Nice! That's correct.\pThis one's from Generation 3. 

#org @gText_Fuschia_GuessCry3_1
Yup, [GREEN]Magmar![BLUE]

#org @gText_Fuschia_GuessCry4
Hmm[.] Unfortunately that's\nincorrect.

#org @gText_FuschiaGuessCry5
Would you like to guess again?

#org @gText_Fuschia_GuessCry6_1
That's [GREEN]Nincada[BLUE] alright.

#org @gText_Fuschia_GuessCry6
Nice. Correct again!\pYou got 2 so far!\pThe next one's from Generation\n4. 

#org @gText_Fuschia_GuessCry7_1
You guessed it, [GREEN]Gallade![BLUE]

#org @gText_Fuschia_GuessCry7
You're on a roll!\pOnly one more cry to go!\pNo hints for this one,\nyou're too good!

#org @gText_Fuschia_GuessGulpin
Gulpin?\nGulpin these nuts!\pGottem!\pHaha, unfortunately that's not\neven the right answer.\pYou'll have to try again!

#org @gText_Fuschia_GuessRhydon
Rhydon?\nRhydon these nuts!\pGottem!\pHaha, unfortunately that's not\neven the right answer.\pYou'll have to try again!

#org @gText_Fuschia_GuessSlugma
Slugma? Slugma nuts!\pGottem!\p[.]Wait, actually, don't do that.\pEither way, that's not even\nthe right answer.\pYou'll have to try again!

#org @gText_TryAgainNextTime
Try again next time then.

#org @gText_Fuschia_GuessCryFinal
Right on, it's [GREEN]Komala![BLUE]

#org @gText_Fuschia_YouGotIt
Woah, you're one gigantic\nnerd bro!\pThat's all four of them.\pNicely done. As promised, I\ncan teach your Pok\emon egg\lmoves.

#org @gText_Fuschia_DotDotDot
[.]

#org @gText_Fuschia_WhichOne
Alright, what's your guess?

